SUMMARY:Farmers Markets (a reminder)
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**Hendersonville Farmers Market**\nSaturday
 s\, 8:00 a.m. until 1:00 p.m. thru October\; Rain or shine!\n**Historic Tr
 ain Depot** Plaza\; 650 Maple Street\, Hendersonville\,\nhttps://visithend
 ersonvillenc.org/event/hendersonville-farmers-market-2\n**Mills River Farm
 ers Market**\nSaturdays\; 8:00 am – 12 noon\; thru October 31 @ 12:00 pm
 \nMills River Elementary School\; 94 School House Rd\, Mills River\nhttps:
 //visithendersonvillenc.org/event/mills-river-farmers-market-2\n**Etowah L
 ions Farmers Market**\nWednesdays from 3–5:30 PM\, thru October\, rain o
 r shine\n447 Etowah School Road\, Etowah\nhttps://visithendersonvillenc.or
 g/event/etowah-lions-farmers-market\n**Flat Rock Farmers Marke**\nThursday
 s\; 3-6pm\; Thru Oct 29\nPinecrest ARP Church\; 1790 Greenville Hwy\, Hend
 ersonville\nhttps://visithendersonvillenc.org/event/flat-rock-farmers-mark
 et-2\n**Treska’s Tuesday Market**\nTuesdays\; 3:30 – 6 PM\; thru Sept 
 29\nTreska’s on Highland Lake\; 211 Rhett Dr\, Flat Rock\nhttps://www.hi
 ghlandlakecove.com/treskas-tuesday-market
