SUMMARY:Domino Game Evening (1st Wed.)
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nEvery 1st & 3rd Wed.\nYou are convivially i
 nvited to an evening of raucous laughter and abandon while playing (a simp
 lified) **Mexican Train Wreck** Dominoes.\nThis event is for beginners and
 /or for those who do NOT take gaming seriously. This is a ‘social’ eve
 nt. There will be no ‘Book of Hoyle’. There will be no ‘scorekeeping
 ’. Bring yo' funnybone!!\nENTRY FEE: Free\nBYO(non-alcohol)B IN NON-SPIL
 LABLE CONTAINER.\nOptional: You may bring (non-messy) finger food (to shar
 e if you like).\nI have 2 sets of Mexican Train Dominoes. My simplified ve
 rsion of "Mexican Train" was developed by cheating during the long cold Wi
 nters of Wisconsin. The altered ‘rules’ remove all chance of strategy.
  Play is controlled by luck\, happenchance and coincidence.\nGame play wil
 l be explained as succinctly as a Curmudgeon is able.\nPlease keep your RS
 VP’s up to date.
